{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Will you send this once at the end, or at the start, middle and end as well? The stage question lets one form cover all three.","What did the program promise participants? Make sure the rows in the grid cover each of those things.","How will you reach people who left early, since they're the least likely to open an email from you?","Do funders or partners need any of these answers in a report? Add the measures they ask for now."],"howToUseResponses":"Read the answers from people who left early first, because they point at the problems that cost you participants. Compare the usefulness grid by stage to see whether a part of the program helps at the start but fades later. Use the barriers question to separate what you can fix, like session times, from personal circumstances, and share a short \"you said, we did\" note with the next cohort.","customizeSteps":["Rename the grid rows to the actual parts of your program, such as workshops, mentoring or site visits.","Add the program or cohort name as a hidden field on each link so you can compare groups in the dashboard.","Send it at the end of each stage, and a short reminder a few days later to the people who haven't answered."],"faqs":[{"q":"What is a program satisfaction survey?","a":"It asks participants whether a program met their needs, which parts helped, what got in the way and what should change. It's used for training, mentoring, health, education and community programs."},{"q":"What questions should I ask in a program satisfaction survey?","a":"Whether the program met the need they joined for, how useful each part was, what made it hard to take part and what to change. Include people who left early."},{"q":"When should I send a program satisfaction survey?","a":"At the end, and ideally partway through too, so you can still fix things for the current group."},{"q":"Is this the same as a program evaluation?","a":"Not quite. Satisfaction is how participants experienced it; an evaluation also measures outcomes, such as skills gained or goals reached. This survey is a good input to one."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Program satisfaction survey","description":"Hear how participants found a program, including the ones who didn't finish.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_programs00","ref":"welcome","title":"Thanks for taking part in the program. Could you tell us how it's going? It takes about four minutes.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_programs01","ref":"program","title":"Which program did you take part in?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":120},{"id":"blk_programs02","ref":"stage","title":"Where are you in the program?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_just_started","label":"Just started","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_about_halfway","label":"About halfway","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_finished","label":"Finished","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_left_before","label":"I left before the end","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_programs03","ref":"why_left","title":"What made you stop? There's no wrong answer, and it helps us fix things.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_programs04","ref":"need_met","title":"Did the program meet the need you joined it for?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_yes_fully","label":"Yes, fully","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_partly","label":"Partly","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_not_yet","label":"Not yet","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_no","label":"No","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_programs05","ref":"overall","title":"Overall, how satisfied are you with the program?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"rating","scale":5,"shape":"star"},{"id":"blk_programs06","ref":"parts","title":"How useful was each part for you?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"matrix","rows":[{"id":"opt_row_sessions_or","label":"Sessions or classes"},{"id":"opt_row_materials_and","label":"Materials and resources"},{"id":"opt_row_support_from","label":"Support from staff or mentors"},{"id":"opt_row_meeting_other","label":"Meeting other participants"},{"id":"opt_row_updates_about","label":"Updates about times and changes"}],"columns":[{"id":"opt_col_not_useful","label":"Not useful"},{"id":"opt_col_somewhat_useful","label":"Somewhat useful"},{"id":"opt_col_very_useful","label":"Very useful"},{"id":"opt_col_didn_t","label":"Didn't use it"}],"multiplePerRow":false},{"id":"blk_programs07","ref":"most_helpful","title":"What helped you most, and how?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_programs08","ref":"barriers","title":"Did anything make it harder to take part?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_session_times","label":"Session times","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_travel_or_location","label":"Travel or location","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_workload","label":"Workload","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_technology_or_access","label":"Technology or access","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_not_enough_support","label":"Not enough support","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_personal_circumstances","label":"Personal circumstances","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_nothing_got_in","label":"Nothing got in the way","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":7,"allowOther":true},{"id":"blk_programs09","ref":"next_stage","title":"What would make the next stage or the next round more useful?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_programs10","ref":"recommend","title":"How likely are you to recommend this program to someone in your position?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"nps","labelLow":"Not likely","labelHigh":"Extremely likely"},{"id":"blk_programs11","ref":"stay_in_touch","title":"Would you like to hear about the next stage or related programs?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_programs12","ref":"email","title":"Where should we send the details?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"email","unique":false,"businessOnly":false,"allowedDomains":[],"verify":false}],"endings":[{"id":"end_programs01","ref":"end_thanks","title":"Thank you for your feedback","bodyMd":"The program team reads every response and uses it to plan the next round.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]},{"id":"end_programs02","ref":"end_next","title":"You're on the list 📬","bodyMd":"We'll email you when the next stage opens. Thanks for your feedback on this one.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]}],"endingRules":[],"logic":[{"id":"rl_programs01","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[],"groups":[]},"from":"email","target":"end_next","targetKind":"ending"},{"id":"rl_programs02","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"stage"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_just_started"}],"groups":[]},"from":"stage","target":"need_met","targetKind":"block","branch":"tr